RELEASE_VERSION 1.0.0

ID RELEASE-0001

DATE 2026-07-25

STATUS PUBLISHED

TITLE

pace-engine 0.1.0 published to PyPI - PACE is publicly installable.

WHAT

The PACE engine, refactored under a single `pace` namespace, published to
PyPI as the distribution `pace-engine` 0.1.0. Anyone can now
`pip install pace-engine` and use the `pace` CLI: init (and init --guided),
context, doctor, handoff, remember, recall, create. Verified by a clean
install straight from PyPI on a fresh environment.

RESULTS_FROM

DECISION-0001 (open-core business model) and the Phase 2 packaging work
(F2.06 - F2.13).

LINK

https://pypi.org/project/pace-engine/0.1.0/

APPROVED_BY

President Cley Duarte

END
